00:02:14.569 --> 00:02:16.680
The 20 20 election was not close.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.110
It was one of the most secure that we've had.

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:24.680
And as always, with some anecdotal instances
of irregularities, not nearly a fraction of

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:27.939
